{"seq":2,"slug":"task-scheduling","title":"任务调度与分片","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-parallelism/patterns/task-scheduling","wordCount":1155,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"任务调度与分片\">任务调度与分片</h1><p>Worker 池解决了「很多个任务」的问题，却没解决「一个任务本身就很大」的问题——即便把一个耗时两秒的计算丢进 Worker，那条 Worker 线程也会被它独占两秒，期间无法响应取消、无法插入更急的任务、也无法给出进度。而有些计算根本无法卸载（比如必须操作 DOM 的部分），它们留在主线程时更需要被切开。这一篇讲两件事：把大任务切成小片，以及在片与片之间做智能调度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-分片与让出\">核心概念：分片与让出</h2><p>分片（chunking）的核心是把一个长循环拆成若干小批，每批跑几毫秒就主动「让出」控制权，让事件循环有机会去处理输入和绘制，然后再继续下一批。这把一段连续的长任务，变成一串对交互友好的短任务。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[一个大任务 2000ms] --&gt; B{能否卸载到 Worker}&#10;    B --&gt;|纯计算| C[整体丢进 Worker]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Worker 内再分片&lt;br/&gt;以支持进度与取消]&#10;    B --&gt;|需操作 DOM 留主线程| E[主线程分片]&#10;    E --&gt; F[每片执行约 5ms]&#10;    F --&gt; G[让出主线程 处理输入/绘制]&#10;    G --&gt; H{还有剩余?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| F&#10;    H --&gt;|否| I[完成]\">flowchart TD\n    A[一个大任务 2000ms] --&gt; B{能否卸载到 Worker}\n    B --&gt;|纯计算| C[整体丢进 Worker]\n    C --&gt; D[Worker 内再分片&lt;br/&gt;以支持进度与取消]\n    B --&gt;|需操作 DOM 留主线程| E[主线程分片]\n    E --&gt; F[每片执行约 5ms]\n    F --&gt; G[让出主线程 处理输入/绘制]\n    G --&gt; H{还有剩余?}\n    H --&gt;|是| F\n    H --&gt;|否| I[完成]</pre><p>「让出」的时机决定体验。一个常用判据是每片累计执行到约 5 毫秒就让出——远小于长任务的 50 毫秒阈值。让出的方式历来有 <code>setTimeout(0)</code>、<code>MessageChannel</code>、<code>requestIdleCallback</code> 等，各有优先级语义。主线程性能与长任务的度量在 <a href=\"../foundations/main-thread-blocking\">主线程阻塞之痛</a> 已建立，这里聚焦如何主动切分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"scheduler-posttask-带优先级的调度\">scheduler.postTask：带优先级的调度</h2><p>2023 年 Chrome 115 起，Chromium 系浏览器落地了 <code>scheduler.postTask</code>，让你能显式给任务标优先级，不再只能用 <code>setTimeout</code> 这种没有优先级概念的粗糙工具（来源：MDN Scheduler.postTask、chromestatus，2026 年 Firefox/Safari 仍未支持）。它提供三档优先级：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// user-blocking：最高，阻塞用户的关键任务&#10;scheduler.postTask(() =&gt; renderCriticalUI(), { priority: &#39;user-blocking&#39; });&#10;// user-visible：默认，用户能看到但不紧急&#10;scheduler.postTask(() =&gt; processChunk(), { priority: &#39;user-visible&#39; });&#10;// background：最低，空闲才做&#10;scheduler.postTask(() =&gt; prefetchAnalytics(), { priority: &#39;background&#39; });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// user-blocking：最高，阻塞用户的关键任务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>scheduler.postTask(() => renderCriticalUI(), { priority: 'user-blocking' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// user-visible：默认，用户能看到但不紧急</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>scheduler.postTask(() => processChunk(), { priority: 'user-visible' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// background：最低，空闲才做</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>scheduler.postTask(() => prefetchAnalytics(), { priority: 'background' });</span></span></code></pre></div><p>配套的 <code>scheduler.yield()</code>（截至 2026 年仍在推进）让分片循环可以「让出后保住自己的位置」再续跑，避免让出后被低优先级任务插队。下表小结这些调度原语的现状。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原语</th>\n<th>优先级语义</th>\n<th>让出后续跑</th>\n<th>2026 支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>setTimeout(fn, 0)</code></td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>排到队尾</td>\n<td>全面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>MessageChannel</code></td>\n<td>无（比 setTimeout 更快）</td>\n<td>排到队尾</td>\n<td>全面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>requestIdleCallback</code></td>\n<td>空闲时</td>\n<td>空闲再跑</td>\n<td>良好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>scheduler.postTask</code></td>\n<td>三档优先级</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>仅 Chromium</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>scheduler.yield</code></td>\n<td>继承当前</td>\n<td>是，保位</td>\n<td>实验中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>因为 <code>scheduler</code> 尚未全面落地，生产中常见做法是特性检测，有则用 <code>postTask</code>，无则回退到 <code>MessageChannel</code> 分片。<code>isInputPending</code>（Chrome M87 起）还能让你在分片循环里探测「是否有待处理输入」，有则立刻让出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在-worker-内分片-进度与取消\">在 Worker 内分片：进度与取消</h2><p>把大任务丢进 Worker 后，Worker 线程虽然不卡主界面，但仍应在内部分片——不是为了不卡（它本就不卡主线程），而是为了能报告进度和响应取消。做法是把处理循环切段，每段之间检查一个共享的取消标志并回传进度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// Worker 侧：分片处理 + 进度上报 + 可取消&#10;let cancelled = false;&#10;self.onmessage = async (e) =&gt; {&#10;  if (e.data.cmd === &#39;cancel&#39;) {&#10;    cancelled = true;&#10;    return;&#10;  }&#10;  const items = e.data.items;&#10;  const CHUNK = 500;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; items.length; i += CHUNK) {&#10;    if (cancelled) {&#10;      self.postMessage({ type: &#39;cancelled&#39; });&#10;      return;&#10;    }&#10;    process(items.slice(i, i + CHUNK));&#10;    self.postMessage({ type: &#39;progress&#39;, done: i / items.length });&#10;    await new Promise((r) =&gt; setTimeout(r)); // 让出，处理 cancel 消息&#10;  }&#10;  self.postMessage({ type: &#39;done&#39; });&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Worker 侧：分片处理 + 进度上报 + 可取消</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let cancelled = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>self.onmessage = async (e) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (e.data.cmd === 'cancel') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    cancelled = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const items = e.data.items;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const CHUNK = 500;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (let i = 0; i &#x3C; items.length; i += CHUNK) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (cancelled) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      self.postMessage({ type: 'cancelled' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    process(items.slice(i, i + CHUNK));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    self.postMessage({ type: 'progress', done: i / items.length });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r)); // 让出，处理 cancel 消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  self.postMessage({ type: 'done' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里 <code>setTimeout</code> 让出的意义是让 Worker 的事件循环有机会处理可能到达的 <code>cancel</code> 消息——否则一个死循环会把取消消息一直堵在队列里。取消若要求即时，也可用 <a href=\"../messaging/shared-array-buffer\">SharedArrayBuffer 与原子</a> 的 <code>Atomics</code> 让主线程直接翻一个共享标志位，Worker 每片检查它，无需等消息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多-worker-间的任务切分\">多 Worker 间的任务切分</h2><p>当一个可并行的大任务（比如给一百万个粒子做物理步进）要用满多核时，除了分片还要<strong>分区</strong>：把数据按 Worker 数切成几段，每段一个 Worker 并行算，最后归并。切分粒度要平衡——太粗则负载不均，太细则通信开销吃掉收益。设总工作量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>、Worker 数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，理想加速比受 Amdahl 定律约束：若可并行比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，则加速比上限为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\frac{1}{(1 - p) + \\frac{p}{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3524em;vertical-align:-1.031em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7475em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.031em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这解释了为什么加线程收益递减：不可并行的那部分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（含数据切分、结果归并、通信）会封顶总加速。把这条规律记牢，能让你在「再开几个 Worker」时保持清醒。具体到把这类并行计算封装成好用的 API，交给 <a href=\"comlink-rpc\">Comlink 与 RPC 抽象</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分片把长任务切成每片约 5ms 的短任务，片间让出主线程以响应输入与绘制。</li>\n<li><code>scheduler.postTask</code>（Chrome 115+，仅 Chromium）提供三档优先级；未支持处回退到 MessageChannel。</li>\n<li>Worker 内也应分片，目的是报告进度和响应取消，而非避免卡顿。</li>\n<li>即时取消可用 Atomics 共享标志位，避免取消消息被计算循环堵住。</li>\n<li>多 Worker 并行受 Amdahl 定律约束，切分与归并的串行部分会封顶加速比，加线程收益递减。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"worker-pools\">Worker 池</a>：分片产生的小任务由池来并发执行。</li>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"comlink-rpc\">Comlink 与 RPC 抽象</a>：把并行计算封装成异步函数调用。</li>\n<li>跨库 <a href=\"../../web-performance-vitals/runtime/js-main-thread\">Web 性能与 Vitals · 主线程性能</a>：长任务与让出策略的性能背景。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"任务调度与分片","id":"任务调度与分片"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分片与让出","id":"核心概念-分片与让出"},{"level":2,"text":"scheduler.postTask：带优先级的调度","id":"scheduler-posttask-带优先级的调度"},{"level":2,"text":"在 Worker 内分片：进度与取消","id":"在-worker-内分片-进度与取消"},{"level":2,"text":"多 Worker 间的任务切分","id":"多-worker-间的任务切分"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Worker 池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-parallelism/patterns/worker-pools"},"next":{"title":"Comlink 与 RPC 抽象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-parallelism/patterns/comlink-rpc"}}